    "API Key 存在钥匙串里；离开输入框后生效。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The API key is kept in the keychain, and applies when the field loses focus."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API Key はキーチェーンに保存され、入力欄から離れたときに反映されます。"
